            <ArticleTitle>Acute and chronic pelvic pain in female adolescents.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1009-25</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pelvic pain in adolescents is a common and frequently puzzling symptom with many possible causes. The patients who suffer from this symptom, by and large, have diagnosable and treatable causes. A sensible, studied, and progressive approach by a warm and accepting physician usually is the key to successful diagnosis and management of this condition.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
